# Handoff v2

The receiver can open files. Chat names the note. The note is the only copy of the session delta.

Leave product invariants in `always.mdc`. Leave story done-when lines in `PM_PLAN.md`. Leave chain prefix rules in `integration-chain.mdc`. Leave test locks in the tests. A handoff that restates those is over budget before it starts.

Older notes stay as history. Do not edit them. New notes follow this file.

## Chat (three lines, nothing else)

```
You are the agent to execute the below hand off.
Read `doc/handoff/NNNN-HANDOFF-YYYY-MM-DD_HHmm.md`.
Next: story X.Y when asked.
```

## Note

One file: `doc/handoff/NNNN-HANDOFF-YYYY-MM-DD_HHmm.md`. No second copy under `.cursor/handoff/`. New `NNNN`. Never edit an old note. Local timestamp `YYYY-MM-DD_HHmm`.

**≤ 220 words.** Second person. Shape: [`.cursor/handoff/_template.md`](../handoff/_template.md).

| Heading | Contains | Leave out |
|---------|----------|-----------|
| Objective | One sentence: which story, when asked | Sha, version, tests |
| Git | Story, Version, On, Do not, Next | A second copy of those cells anywhere else |
| Decisions | Deltas this ship, one sentence each | Invariants, branch lists, test replay |
| In / Out | The next contract, and what is out | Test names, the step list |
| Acceptance (met) | `headless`, or the human-check result | Case list, counts |
| Acceptance (not yet) | Each red test once: name + one sentence. Chain name and the calls. One look for a missing unit and a missing chain | A retelling under In or Next steps |
| Next steps | Order of work | Restating the tests |
| Measured | Counts versus the prior run, or `none this turn` | Shas |
| Blockers | Facts not in git. Omit the heading when there are none | Anything already in Git |
| Filename | Last line | |

“Which story, when asked” appears in Objective and in Git **Next**. Nowhere else.

This line stays verbatim, on its own line, between **Next steps** and **Measured**:

`write thorough tests. red, integration, find missing ones of both kinds.`

Gates stay in the SWAT file only ([handoff-checklist.mdc](handoff-checklist.mdc)).

## Tracked state, also once

`AGENT_HANDOFF.md` → *Current state* is Product (one sentence plus links), On, Next, Blockers. It does not retell stories or rules.

`PM_PLAN.md` keeps done-when and a chain-name index. It does not grow an assertion essay.

`doc/PROJECT_STATUS.md` summary is one short paragraph. Its branch table is the only branch list.

## Receiver

Open the named file once. Do not open older notes. Do not open a twin copy. Do not echo this brief. Start the named story only when the human asks. Trust **On**. `git status` is for a dirty tree before an edit.
